title: "PIANO_G4_cbt6 — Sensor board firmware for an optical digital MIDI piano"
abstract: >-
  Firmware for the sensor boards (STM32G474) of a self-built digital MIDI
  piano with optical key sensing. Uses on-chip analog comparators and
  high-resolution timers to measure hammer flight time for each key, detects
  note-on/note-off events, reports timings to the PIANO_H7 controller over a
  multidrop address-detect UART, and supports calibration and a custom
  bootloader for over-the-bus firmware updates.
